.TH Command NATION
.SY "nation"
The nation report command displays various data about your country.
.s3
The data displayed by the nation command is formatted as a single page
report and should be self explanatory.
For example:
.EX nation
.NF
	Groonland Nation Report       Sun Jan 18 17:19:31 1981
Nation status is ACTIVE     Bureaucratic Time Units: 255
Last nation update occurred on Sun Jan 18 17:17:49 1981
Capital is 100% efficient and has 87 civilians and 80 military
